    "desc": "An interactive map of where wauke grows on Oʻahu, and where it could, design as a tool for cultural restoration.",
    "awardNum": "UX",
    "awardLabel": "Ecological Mapping Tool",
    "category": "Interaction · Ecological Design",
    "title": "Wauke: A Living Map of Possibility",
    "subtitle": "Design as a tool for cultural restoration.",
    "award": "",
